      "ttftMs": 436.63479799999914,
      "endToEndMs": 2681,
      "finishReason": "stop",
      "modelText": "Hi,\n\nYou can change the email address you use to sign in to Nimbus at any time by going to Settings > Account > Email address and clicking Change [1]. Then, enter your new address and your current password [1]. A confirmation link will be sent to the new address, and a notice will be sent to your old address [1]. You must click the link within 24 hours to finish the change [1]. \n\nPlease note that for business accounts, your email address is managed by your company's administrator, and you will need to ask them to change it in the admin console [2]. Additionally, the new address cannot already be used by another Nimbus account [2].",
