      "invalidCitations": 0,
      "ttftMs": 675.8134370000043,
      "endToEndMs": 7429,
      "finishReason": "stop",
      "modelText": "Hi,\n\nNimbus stores data in two regions: the European Union in Frankfurt, Germany, and the United States in Virginia [1]. Personal, Family, and Free accounts are stored in the region closest to where you signed up, while Business customers choose their region when creating the team [1].",
